      "description": "<A matriarchal furbolg speaks to you from within the cage>\r\n\r\n\"Deadwood trap me and my cub in tough cage. Key hang on Deadwood Warden belt. You hunt them, take key, lift latch, set us free. Do this, and Barkskin know your heart true.\"",
